{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And he fled and went outside.</b> The Holy One, blessed be He, said to him: By the merit of 'וינס,' in your lifetime the sea will flee before your ark. This is what Scripture says: ״הים ראה וינס״ — what did it see? The ark of Joseph."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:44.396799967Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}